{"4811910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Destination Gemini", "steam_appid": 4811910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long ago, Earth was visited by Gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most likely, they were extraterrestrials possessing godlike technologies. According to the legend, some of that technology was given to humanity to help mankind rise from the mud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain civilizations prospered, but jealousy and greed became their downfall. Many wars were fought for control of this powerful technology. After humanity came close to extinction, it was decided that no one should ever use it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It took a very long time for mankind to recover and prosper once more, but eventually it did. Meanwhile, the knowledge of the Gods, along with the gifts they gave to humanity, was lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But recently, you uncovered new information pointing your search beyond our own solar system. You believe there is a good chance that what you are looking for still exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, you board your old ship for another adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the navigation coordinates into the onboard computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destination: the Gemini Region.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Explore, Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, you will send colonization teams to claim planets as your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will improve mining, research, and construction facilities to increase automated resource gathering and production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your scientists will uncover new technologies, including the <strong>Cold Fusion Drive</strong> and the <strong>Oblivion Cannon Array</strong>, allowing you to equip <strong>14 different ship classes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will command fleets of warships and send them on missions throughout the Gemini Region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will establish trade routes between your colonies and develop a thriving interplanetary economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archaeological digs</strong> can be opened on every planet, sometimes leading to extraordinary discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will interact with <strong>alien traders</strong> who often try to sell you their junk but occasionally offer exactly what you have been searching for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Colonize and develop planets throughout the Gemini Region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Research advanced technologies and equip 14 different ship classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Command fleets of warships and complete missions across space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Establish trade routes between your colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Conduct archaeological excavations and uncover ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trade with alien merchants and search for lost artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you become the next Indiana of space in this indie adventure?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811910/extras/7693aeb35386f23a9b3e20f1810849ab.avif?t=1785739495\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long ago, Earth was visited by Gods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most likely, they were extraterrestrials possessing godlike technologies. According to the legend, some of that technology was given to humanity to help mankind rise from the mud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain civilizations prospered, but jealousy and greed became their downfall. Many wars were fought for control of this powerful technology. After humanity came close to extinction, it was decided that no one should ever use it again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It took a very long time for mankind to recover and prosper once more, but eventually it did. Meanwhile, the knowledge of the Gods, along with the gifts they gave to humanity, was lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But recently, you uncovered new information pointing your search beyond our own solar system. You believe there is a good chance that what you are looking for still exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, you board your old ship for another adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enter the navigation coordinates into the onboard computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destination: the Gemini Region.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Explore, Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, you will send colonization teams to claim planets as your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will improve mining, research, and construction facilities to increase automated resource gathering and production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your scientists will uncover new technologies, including the <strong>Cold Fusion Drive</strong> and the <strong>Oblivion Cannon Array</strong>, allowing you to equip <strong>14 different ship classes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will command fleets of warships and send them on missions throughout the Gemini Region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will establish trade routes between your colonies and develop a thriving interplanetary economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archaeological digs</strong> can be opened on every planet, sometimes leading to extraordinary discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will interact with <strong>alien traders</strong> who often try to sell you their junk but occasionally offer exactly what you have been searching for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Colonize and develop planets throughout the Gemini Region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Research advanced technologies and equip 14 different ship classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Command fleets of warships and complete missions across space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Establish trade routes between your colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Conduct archaeological excavations and uncover ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trade with alien merchants and search for lost artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you become the next Indiana of space in this indie adventure?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811910/extras/7693aeb35386f23a9b3e20f1810849ab.avif?t=1785739495\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>", "short_description": "You are a space archaeologist searching for ancient and powerful artifacts. After a lifetime spent chasing myths and legends, you finally uncover clues leading to the mysterious Gemini region. Aboard your old but trusted ship, you set course for the adventure of a lifetime.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Finding ancient artifacts was easily my favorite part. Every excavation feels like it might reveal something that changes the whole expedition.”<br>Recommended – McThunder's<br><br>“Building fleets and sending them across the region adds a nice sense of scale. It feels good watching a small operation become a real space empire.”<br>Recommended – Schoolgirl Warriors<br><br>“Expand beyond the Solar System, develop new technologies and see where the search for lost knowledge leads.”<br>Recommended – ReviewRelic<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811910/bd0752c2e64b39275cbde9e872ae526b294c0b91/header.jpg?t=1785739495", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811910/199c4f67f2c585975ed4dbdde325eeeb8a3259ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785739495", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811910/199c4f67f2c585975ed4dbdde325eeeb8a3259ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785739495", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 2.5 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 680<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1670 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> A sound card is a must... unless you're Charlie Chaplin.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is the oldest computer I used for testing. It may also run on older systems.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i9 or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3000 series or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Everyone has one, right? Seriously, who doesn't have one?</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Hubert Cachat<br />\r\nHC © Copyright 2026", "developers": ["Hubert Cachat"], "publishers": ["HC"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 899, "final": 899, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$8.99"}, "packages": [1672185], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Destination Gemini", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1672185, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Destination Gemini - $8.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 899}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811910/93f0e597382a463f6e60e5e59e0dc97d6ba93f9c/ss_93f0e597382a463f6e60e5e5